window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Jeremy’s travel plans were simple.</b></p>Number 1 - Follow the clues that he and the rest of his family had found, weed through the intentional deception, secrets, and mostly outright lies.<br>Number 2 - With a little luck, solve the mystery about a royal family torn apart and ripped from their home hundreds of years ago in a long forgotten past.<br>Number 3 - He was looking for the truth however dark and dismal it might turn out to be. Compared to his brothers, he might be an amateur detective, but he was surprisingly determined.<p><b>No complications...or involved relationships...or love.</b></p><p><br><b>Madeleine had plans for her vacation after making yet another change in her life.</b></p>Number 1 - Spend a little time looking into the her family’s intriguing history as she’d promised her grandfather.<br>Number 2 - Enjoy the food, walk around the small and unique village, and tour the castle where it all began and tragically ended if the stories she’d heard since childhood were true.<br><br>Then she knocked on a hotel door to keep a promise made...and everything changed.<p><b>Maybe love really could come knocking when least expected.</b></p>Travel with Jeremy and Madeleine as they combine their efforts to search for more of the Delasina family’s long hidden clues in the hope they can unravel the dark mystery of one woman’s fate amidst betrayal, carefully guarded family secrets, tragic deception, daring life-long lies, and heart-wrenching love. But solving the historical crime wasn't easy.<br><br>When they find the truth...it is almost as impossible to believe as were the many secrets kept and lies told to hide it.<br><br>If you enjoy mystery romance and women’s fiction filled with adventure, love, hope, family ties, close knit friendships, and a mystery with twists and turns to keep you guessing, the Secrets of the River series collection is for you.<br><br>Cozy up with this captivating page turner and your favorite hot or cold drink any season of the year and enjoy!<br><br>Deception, Quiet Lies, and Love is the fourth book in the compelling and engaging Secrets of the River series.<br><br><b>Secrets of the River series</b><br>After Night Falls<br>Midnight in Darkness<br>Deadly Serious"; 
